<li about="#cite_note-60" id="cite_note-60" data-mw-footnote-number="60"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBe8"><a href="#cite_ref-60" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBfA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBfE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-60" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt208" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwBfI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite book\n ","href":"./Template:Cite_book"},"params":{"last1":{"wt":"Raadschelders"},"first1":{"wt":"Jos C. N."},"author-link1":{"wt":"Jos C.N. Raadschelders"},"editor-last1":{"wt":"Ladner"},"editor-first1":{"wt":"Andreas"},"editor-last2":{"wt":"Sager"},"editor-first2":{"wt":"Fritz"},"date":{"wt":"13 October 2022"},"chapter":{"wt":"The evolution of bureaucracy as a political actor: from instrument for power, via iron cage, to container and guardian of democracy"},"title":{"wt":"Handbook on the Politics of Public Administration"},"url":{"wt":"https://books.google.com/books?id=wW-VEAAAQBAJ"},"series":{"wt":"Elgar Handbooks in Public Administration and Management"},"publication-place":{"wt":"Cheltenham"},"publisher":{"wt":"Edward Elgar Publishing"},"page":{"wt":"14"},"isbn":{"wt":"9781839109447"},"access-date":{"wt":"16 October 2025"},"quote":{"wt":"[...] Albert Hein, Amnesty International, Bayer, Boeing, Carrefour, Enron, Greenpeace, Huawei, the Red Cross, Volkswagen, Walmart etc., cannot but operate as bureaucracies. Any assembly-line work process in industry is the ultimate bureaucratic structure, while most other types of organizations (e.g., educational institutions, organized religions, labor unions, sports clubs etc.) will have several elements that are characteristic for bureaucratic structure."},"archive-date":{"wt":"7 November 2025"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251107051208/https://books.google.com/books?id=wW-VEAAAQBAJ"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="mwBfM" class="citation book cs1" about="#mwt208" data-x-id="CITEREFRaadschelders2022"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jos_C.N._Raadschelders" title="Jos C.N. Raadschelders" id="mwBfQ">Raadschelders, Jos C. N.</a> (13 October 2022). "The evolution of bureaucracy as a political actor: from instrument for power, via iron cage, to container and guardian of democracy". In Ladner, Andreas; Sager, Fritz (eds.). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://books.google.com/books?id=wW-VEAAAQBAJ" class="external text" id="mwBfU"><i id="mwBfY">Handbook on the Politics of Public Administration</i></a>. Elgar Handbooks in Public Administration and Management. Cheltenham: Edward Elgar Publishing. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBfc"> </span>14. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBfg">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBfk"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/9781839109447" title="Special:BookSources/9781839109447" id="mwBfo"><bdi id="mwBfs">9781839109447</bdi></a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20251107051208/https://books.google.com/books?id=wW-VEAAAQBAJ" class="external text" id="mwBfw">Archived</a> from the original on 7 November 2025<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBf0">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBf4">16 October</span> 2025</span>. <q id="mwBf8">[...] Albert Hein, Amnesty International, Bayer, Boeing, Carrefour, Enron, Greenpeace, Huawei, the Red Cross, Volkswagen, Walmart etc., cannot but operate as bureaucracies. Any assembly-line work process in industry is the ultimate bureaucratic structure, while most other types of organizations (e.g., educational institutions, organized religions, labor unions, sports c