-8</bdi></a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SSRN_(identifier)" title="SSRN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBsQ">SSRN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBsU"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=4105786" class="external text" id="mwBsY">4105786</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Oxford+Handbook+of+Historical+Political+Economy&amp;rft.atitle=Bureaucracies+in+Historical+Political+Economy&amp;rft.pages=C19.S1-C19.N41&amp;rft.date=2023&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1093%2Foxfordhb%2F9780197618608.013.19&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fpapers.ssrn.com%2Fsol3%2Fpapers.cfm%3Fabstract_id%3D4105786%23id-name%3DSSRN&amp;rft.isbn=978-0-19-761860-8&amp;rft.aulast=Vogler&amp;rft.aufirst=Jan+P.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABureaucracy" class="Z3988" about="#mwt253" id="mwBsc"></span><span class="cs1-maint citation-comment" about="#mwt253" id="mwBsg"><code class="cs1-code" id="mwBsk">{{<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:Cite_journal" title="Template:Cite journal" id="mwBso">cite journal</a>}}</code>:  CS1 maint: periodical has ISBN (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:CS1_maint:_periodical_has_ISBN" title="Category:CS1 maint: periodical has ISBN" id="mwBss">link</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_maint:_periodical_has_ISBN" about="#mwt253" id="mwBsw"/></span></li>
